OL,3,APolice chief names two 'brave' officers
OL,4,Aamong seven people killed in crash near
OL,5,AMiddlesbrough
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham says he is
OL,8,F"devastated" to hear about the crash,
OL,9,Fand thanks emergency services
OL,11,FShadow home secretary Chris Philp also
OL,12,Foffers his condolences, saying the
OL,13,Fpolice watchdog, the IOPC, "must be
OL,14,Fgiven the time and space to complete
OL,15,Ftheir investigations without
OL,16,Fspeculation"
OL,18,FImages show a large emergency services
OL,19,Fresponse at the scene - North East
OL,20,FAmbulance Service says it sent "14
OL,21,Fambulance resources"
